#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:373
msgid ""
"**KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD** - пароль для dmin user для входа в "
"https://example.ecos24.ru/auth"
msgstr ""
"**KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD** - password for admin user to log in at "
"https://example.ecos24.ru/auth"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:374
msgid "**JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS** - параметры Java"
msgstr "**JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS** - Java parameters"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:375
msgid "**DB_VENDOR** -  вендор БД"
msgstr "**DB_VENDOR** - database vendor"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:376
msgid "**DB_ADDR** - имя сервиса БД"
msgstr "**DB_ADDR** - database service name"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:377
msgid "**DB_PORT** -  порт , по которому доступна база данных"
msgstr "**DB_PORT** - port on which the database is accessible"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:378
msgid "**DB_DATABASE** - имя БД"
msgstr "**DB_DATABASE** - database name"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:379
msgid "**DB_USER** - пользователь БД"
msgstr "**DB_USER** - database user"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:380
msgid "**DB_PASSWORD** - пароль для входа в БД"
msgstr "**DB_PASSWORD** - password for database login"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:381
msgid ""
"**JGROUPS_DISCOVERY_PROTOCOL** - протокол, для возможности работы Keycloak в"
" режиме HA с 2 репликами"
msgstr ""
"**JGROUPS_DISCOVERY_PROTOCOL** - protocol for enabling Keycloak to work in "
"HA mode with 2 replicas"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:382
msgid ""
"**JGROUPS_DISCOVERY_PROPERTIES** - имя сервиса, для общения 2х реплик "
"Keycloak при развертывании в режиме HA"
msgstr ""
"**JGROUPS_DISCOVERY_PROPERTIES** - service name for communication between 2 "
"Keycloak replicas when deployed in HA mode"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:383
msgid "**CACHE_OWNERS_COUNT** - количество owner при режиме HA"
msgstr "**CACHE_OWNERS_COUNT** - number of owners in HA mode"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:384
msgid ""
"**CACHE_OWNERS_AUTH_SESSIONS_COUNT** - количество активных сеансов для "
"владельца кеша ( установить в соответсвии с CACHE_OWNERS_COUNT )"
msgstr ""
"**CACHE_OWNERS_AUTH_SESSIONS_COUNT** - number of active sessions for the "
"cache owner (set in accordance with CACHE_OWNERS_COUNT)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/docker_services/eis_Keycloak.rst:385
